Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.70,0:03:52.70,En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)}Mahadev akela hai, par baaqi hai aas
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:04:06.70,Hi,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)}हर हर… महादेव…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:04:06.70,En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)}Har Har… Mahadev…
